### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### GET /api/v1/sub-orders/{subOrderId}/items — Items of a sub-order
### SubOrderController.getSubOrderItems
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

@subOrderBase = {{host}}/api/v1/sub-orders

###
# @name get-sub-order-items-ok
### [1] Happy path
GET {{subOrderBase}}/{{subOrderId}}/items

###
# @name get-sub-order-items-not-found
### [2] Non-existent sub-order (expect 404)
GET {{subOrderBase}}/{{randomUuid}}/items
